            "Drelichman and Voth's research presented\na novel body of evidence supporting\nHoffman and Norberg's hypothesis\nregarding why Philip II default on several\nloans."
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "explanation": "Correct answer is A (Answer Key: Topic 2, Q48). Verified from SAToplam 2.0 Reading real exam compilation."
